PuggieType is a fork of Monkeytype, forked from upstream commit 0addedb
on 2026-10-16 (imported here as commit 9ed43ca).

Modified by the PuggieType team since 2026-10-16. Main changes:
- new name, original pug mascot, logo, favicons and themes;
- accounts and the upstream backend removed or disabled; the frontend
  runs standalone as a static site;
- a private-lobby multiplayer client added (random server-assigned
  nicknames, no chat);
- PuggieType Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, footer legal notice,
  robots.txt, sitemap and canonical URLs pointing at puggietype.com;
- Sentry, Google Analytics and Firebase analytics removed; ad code
  replaced by a no-op hook; reCAPTCHA loaded only with a backend;
- upstream CI workflows removed.
The full list of changes is in the git history.

